{"id":"nesomnenno","lemma":"несомненно","pos":"adv","rank":1261,"glosses":["undoubtedly, without doubt, doubtlessly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/ae/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ты несомненно уже слышал новости.","en":"Doubtless you've heard the news.","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"already"},{"g":"to hear","l":"слышать"},{"g":"news"}]},{"text":"Том, несомненно, завтра там будет.","en":"Tom will be there tomorrow without question.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"tomorrow"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"}]},{"text":"Он, несомненно, человек слова.","en":"He is, indeed, a man of his word.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"person"},{"g":"word, term","l":"слово"}]},{"text":"Этот фильм тебе несомненно следует посмотреть.","en":"This is definitely a movie that you should watch.","words":[{"g":"this/that one"},{"g":"film, movie"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},null,{"g":"to follow","l":"следовать"},{"g":"to look"}]},{"text":"Несомненно, он это выдумал.","en":"He must have made it up.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/654002","words":[null,{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]}]}